WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:01.880
Welcome to TTM Site Assurance

00:01.880 --> 00:03.959
Assessor, a Sela Civil Advisory

00:03.959 --> 00:05.720
course. You already know how to

00:05.720 --> 00:06.960
set up and run a temporary

00:06.960 --> 00:08.679
traffic management site. This

00:08.679 --> 00:10.027
course is about the next step:

00:10.787 --> 00:12.027
standing back from a site you

00:12.027 --> 00:13.867
didn't build. You've got to judge

00:13.867 --> 00:15.067
whether it really protects the

00:15.067 --> 00:16.987
people working in it and travelling

00:16.987 --> 00:18.427
through it.

00:18.427 --> 00:20.054
And always act on what you find.
